; resources (docs/ART.md 6.1): small objects, 13x13 with the feet at (6, 12), drawn standing in the
; tile's lower right (feet at tile 25,30) on a soft shadow: the sheaf, the cow, the ingot, the gem...
; Mana resources are standing stones carved with their sphere's rune (colour = family, shape =
; sphere, 11.5). Painted by tools/atlas/compose_map.py; the category objects (_food, _strategic,
; _luxury, _mana) are the fallbacks.

